### BCP PDF Extractor - REST Client Tests
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### === HEALTH CHECK ===

### 1. Health Check - Get API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api
Accept: application/json

###



### === PDF PROCESSING WITH DATABASE ===

### 2. Process PDF and Save to Database (NEW - Port 8003)
# Extrae datos del PDF y los guarda como JSON en la tabla Documents

# @name populateDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_07750301.PDF",
    "type": "debit",
    "user_email": "admin@bcpextractor.com"
}

###



### === TRANSACTIONS ===

### 3. Load Transactions from Document
# Migra los datos de la columna 'data' del documento a la tabla transactions
# Reemplaza {document_id} con el UUID del documento que quieres procesar

# @name populateTransaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/load-from-document/{{populateDocument.response.body.$.document_id}}
Accept: application/json

###
